        "original_id": "52f146f1-3caa-54a5-8070-d599aaa30012",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Jumper: Griffin's Story, Jumper\n- People: Steven Gould\n- Topics: Publication, Film release, Box office, Critical reception, Adaptation changes\n\nFacts:\n- Steven Gould's novel \"Jumper: Griffin's Story\" was released on August 21, 2007.\n- \"Jumper: Griffin's Story\" was published as a prequel to the film \"Jumper.\"\n- The 2008 film \"Jumper\" opened in first place at the box office with $27.3 million during its opening weekend.\n- Critics gave the film \"Jumper\" generally unfavourable reviews.\n- Critics mostly criticized the film \"Jumper\" for making many changes from Steven Gould's novel, having a rushed plot, and ending anti-climactically.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
